    "name": "Inventory Backend",
    "description": "Inventory Management Module API.\n\n**Seed password for all users:** `Password123!`\n**Agent key:** `seed-agent-delhi-key`\n**Base URL:** `{{baseUrl}}`\n\n## Role → API access (aligned with frontend)\n| Role | Weekly report `/reports/weekly` | Users | Permissions (read/write) | Audit | Devices/Clients/OND |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| SUPER_ADMIN | yes | yes | read+write | yes | full |\n| DGN_IT_MANAGER | yes | no | read | yes | view/edit/delete* |\n| SERVICE_MANAGER | yes | no | read | no | view/edit |\n| IT_ENGINEER | yes | no | no | no | view/edit |\n| CLIENT_MANAGER | **no** (403) | no | no | no | view |\n| EMPLOYEE | **no** (403) | no | no | no | view |\n\n\\* Delete on Device/OND/Client is DGN_IT_MANAGER (SUPER_ADMIN bypasses).\n\nFrontend home: staff → `/overview`; CLIENT_MANAGER & EMPLOYEE → `/assets`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
